Title:  The intricate riddle of life

Seq:    12.6.152.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Shelley, Mary|Mary Shelley]], 1826, from the book *[[The Last Man]]*

Timestamp: 20251218192020

Date Added: 2025-12-18 12:20:20 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: We pursue growth and development

Body:

There is but one solution to the intricate riddle of life; to improve ourselves, and contribute to the happiness of others.

